# Semgrep SAST CLI used by the "Semgrep SAST Analysis" job.
#
# Every semgrep release pins mcp==1.29.0 and opentelemetry ~=1.37.0, which
# have published advisories (mcp: fixed in 1.30.0; opentelemetry-api
# CVE-2026-114603: fixed in 1.45.1). The scan never runs Semgrep's MCP server
# or parses inbound trace headers, but the lock must not carry a
# known-vulnerable package, so overrides.txt lifts them to fixed versions and
# the job installs this lock with --no-deps (every transitive dependency is
# pinned and hashed here). The scan runs in CI with these versions. The lock
# lives outside the Dependabot-managed .github/scripts directory because
# Dependabot would regenerate it without the overrides; the "Dependency
# audit" job audits it on every change.
#
# requirements.txt is generated from this file with the command in its
# header; set --exclude-newer to 7 days ago (the Dependabot cooldown).
# --no-annotate keeps uv's "# via --override ..." comment lines out of the
# lock: OWASP Dependency-Check parses them as a package.
semgrep==1.179.0
